{"candidateAnswer":"Harry Potter, Game of Thrones, Lord of the Rings","evidence":"[D8:16 | 4:29 pm on 21 August, 2023] Tim: Yeah, \"Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone\" is special to me. It was the first movie from the series and brings back some great memories. Watching it with my family was amazing. It was so magical!\n[D8:18 | 4:29 pm on 21 August, 2023] Tim: It was really a dream come true! Watching that movie with my family was awesome, we'd all get comfy with snacks and a blanket and be totally absorbed. Such a special memory!\n[D26:28 | 3:35 pm on 26 December, 2023] Tim: Yeah, I have! Watching them and seeing how they compare to the books is awesome. It's amazing to watch the story come alive. Have you seen all of them?\n[D26:32 | 3:35 pm on 26 December, 2023] Tim: I'm a huge fan of this genre! Epic adventures and magical worlds are my thing. Here's a pic of my favorite, Lord of the Rings!\n[D27:21 | 5:26 pm on 2 January, 2024] Tim: Definitely Star Wars! It's my favorite and never gets old. What about you, do you have any favorite fantasy films?","itemId":"urn:uuid:826e1422-19f7-5680-a175-7a1e68116f6a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:439ea8d8ef9e74e1ac3c2c946f1282d4fcddcebb52c073eff6c62f2d5b8f7724","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What fantasy movies does Tim like?","referenceAnswer":"Lord of the Rings, Harry Potter, and Star Wars.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"439ea8d8ef9e74e1ac3c2c946f1282d4fcddcebb52c073eff6c62f2d5b8f7724"}}]}